flowchart LR
    accTitle: The bounded agent loop
    accDescr: Inspect state, plan a bounded step, authorize it, act, verify the real result, and reach explicit complete, stop, or containment states.

    G([Goal and success criteria]) --> I[Inspect current state]
    I --> P[Plan one bounded step]
    P --> A{Authorized?}
    A -->|No| S([Stop and explain])
    A -->|Yes| X[Execute one action]
    X --> V{Postcondition verified?}
    V -->|Yes: goal complete| D([Complete with evidence])
    V -->|Yes: more work| I
    V -->|Failed or uncertain| C[Contain side effects]
    C --> R[Reconcile actual state]
    R --> N{Safe to continue?}
    N -->|Yes| I
    N -->|No| S
